                                                "sense_id": "c17eda31-2ac9-31d9-a946-4c6fdcf6fa31",
                                                "text": "The Texas Rangers investigation is one of at least five announced investigations targeting EPIC or EPIC City. Those include investigations led by Texas Attorney General Ken Paxton, the Texas Workforce Commission, the Texas State Board of Securities and the Texas Funeral Service Commission."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
